        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #43960.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4348950633\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43960\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43960/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43960\">#43960</a>. The current example is unhelpful while there's an actually helpful situation.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I failed to come up with any compelling use case for <code class=\"notranslate\">Document.moveBefore</code> so I've kept it as-is.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Also fixed some other technical errors.</p>",
